before:
Complete local Java example; the app itself does not execute it:
```java
enum Mode { READ, REST }
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Mode mode = Mode.READ;
        String action = switch (mode) {
            case READ -> "open book";
            case REST -> "pause";
        };
        System.out.println(action);
    }
}

```

